    "preamble": "Shri Nikhil Shah S/O Shri Krishnakant ... vs State Of Rajasthan on 27 January, 2022 Author: Manoj Kumar Vyas",
    "facts": "It has been submitted by learned counsel for the petitioners that a complaint (Annexure-10) has been filed in the learned trial Court under Section 16 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. It is further submitted that second RFL report was received on 16.06.2014, whereas the life of the product expired before the date of report. The manufacturing date of product was January, 2013 and it was also mentioned that it was best before nine months from the date of manufacture.",
